{"id":375,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間是宝と今日学べで伸びる栄東","feature_description":"栄東中学校・高等学校は、『人間是宝』『今日学べ』を掲げ、生徒の個性や能力を最大限に引き出す学校です。日々をその日のうちにやり切る姿勢と、スポーツで心身を育てる方針が明確で、部活動も学習と並行して力を伸ばしやすいです。毎日の積み重ねを大切にする校風が、学力と人間力の両方を支えています。目標に向けて継続できる環境です。学びの幅も広がります。","clubs":[{"id":6867,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6868,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6869,"name":"アーチェリー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6870,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6871,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6872,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6873,"name":"男子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6874,"name":"女子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6875,"name":"高校アメフト部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/club-news.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6876,"name":"高校アーチェリー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/club-news.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6877,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/club-news.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6878,"name":"囲碁・将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sakaehigashi.ed.jp/schoollife/club/club-news.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6